  "prefLabel": "Ncr 845.03 Winter Snowmobile Application for Grant-in-Aid",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 845.03 Winter Snowmobile Application for Grant-in-Aid. Snowmobile clubs and political subdivisions applying for GIA for winter snowmobile operations and parking lot snow removal shall complete, and submit the “Winter Snowmobile Application for Grant-In-Aid” form, 2025 June.\n\nSource. #14293, eff 6-25-25, EXPIRES: 6-25-35",
